{"id": 10, "kind": "conversation", "title": "Где апте́ка?", "en": "Where is the pharmacy?", "level": "A1", "after": 10, "pic": "pill.png", "speakers": {"p": {"name": "Же́нщина", "en": "woman", "pic": "old_woman.png"}, "a": {"name": "Али́", "en": "Ali", "pic": "man.png", "me": true}}, "sentences": [{"sp": "a", "ru": "Извини́те, вы не зна́ете, где здесь апте́ка?", "en": "Excuse me, do you know where there's a pharmacy here?", "audio": "b1a2a4632d.mp3"}, {"sp": "p", "ru": "Апте́ка? Да, зна́ю. Э́то недалеко́.", "en": "A pharmacy? Yes, I know. It's not far.", "audio": "1074ee3991.mp3"}, {"sp": "p", "ru": "Иди́те пря́мо, пото́м напра́во.", "en": "Go straight, then to the right.", "audio": "a05aa54dbe.mp3"}, {"sp": "a", "ru": "Пря́мо и напра́во. А пото́м?", "en": "Straight and to the right. And then?", "audio": "36098545b0.mp3"}, {"sp": "p", "ru": "Пото́м вы уви́дите банк. Апте́ка сле́ва от ба́нка.", "en": "Then you'll see a bank. The pharmacy is to the left of the bank.", "audio": "e31cf2297c.mp3"}, {"sp": "a", "ru": "А э́то далеко́? Мо́жно дойти́ пешко́м?", "en": "And is it far? Can I walk there?", "audio": "2de1fbb449.mp3"}, {"sp": "p", "ru": "Да, коне́чно. Пять мину́т пешко́м.", "en": "Yes, of course. Five minutes on foot.", "audio": "cd42674b26.mp3"}, {"sp": "a", "ru": "Большо́е спаси́бо!", "en": "Thank you very much!", "audio": "5c581ba024.mp3"}, {"sp": "p", "ru": "Не́ за что. Всего́ хоро́шего!", "en": "You're welcome. All the best!", "audio": "62c8e76b8e.mp3"}], "gloss": {"вы": {"w": "вы", "lemma": "вы", "en": "you", "info": "", "pr": "vih", "audio": "095be3df8a.mp3", "k": "вы"}, "не": {"w": "не́", "lemma": "не", "en": "not", "info": "Вы не зна́ете…? = Do you happen to know…? (polite)", "pr": "nye", "audio": "329b2b144c.mp3", "k": "не"}, "знаете": {"w": "зна́ете", "lemma": "знать", "en": "(you) know", "info": "знать, вы form", "pr": "ZNA-ye-tye", "audio": "0c79a1c971.mp3", "k": "знать"}, "где": {"w": "где", "lemma": "где", "en": "where", "info": "", "pr": "gdye", "a